  "details": "I and another player were playing in a public card game world, with some of my friends and a bunch of others.\nA user joined and was shouting slurs, we couldn't kick him as he had a modded client.\n\nMy menu became unresponsive in a way that I couldn't click on other users. I and another user experianced a ban for apparently having a \"modded client\" when we did not.\n\nCan this exploit be patched?",
